 tiles (W2, W3\u00d73, W4\u00d72) which offer multiple completion possibilities. The character tiles can form various melds depending on what I draw. This keeps maximum flexibility for achieving a winning hand while removing a dead tile.\n\nAnswer: Play T6"}
